  m_text: "A mysterious being of grace and menace, Raviel stands tall like a shadow-forged
    steed, wings folded in silent defiance. Though his form appears elegant, his
    true strength lies beneath\u2014bones forged from metal-rich essence, unyielding
    to blade or flame. With eyes like molten gold and horns that hum with elemental
    resonance, Raviel glides through the battlefield with haunting poise. Few dare
    to confront him head-on, for every step he takes echoes like armor across the
    plains of war."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
